# The guardrail image is built from the repository root because it packages modules from
# several top-level directories. Send only its runtime files; Terraform provider caches
# alone are hundreds of MB and must never become Docker build context.
**
!guardrails/
!guardrails/**
!prompt/
!prompt/**
!rag/
!rag/**
!guardrail_service/
!guardrail_service/**
!data/
!data/xanhsm_retrieval_mock/
!data/xanhsm_retrieval_mock/corpus/
!data/xanhsm_retrieval_mock/corpus/retrieval_corpus.jsonl
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
